<section aria-labelledby="philosophy-heading">
  <h2 id="philosophy-heading">Design philosophy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Local-first</strong> — vaults are local; there is no cloud sync.</li>
    <li><strong>Explicit</strong> — vault selection, backups, and password handling are user-controlled.</li>
    <li><strong>CLI-first</strong> — the command line is the primary interface.</li>
    <li><strong>In progress</strong> — the Textual terminal interface is an early prototype.</li>
    <li><strong>Transparent</strong> — source code and project security documentation are public.</li>
  </ul>
</section>